{"id":"91532bc163cf2518","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-weyl-sum.md","title":"Weyl Sum","display":"df-weyl-sum — Weyl Sum","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-weyl-sum","aliases":["58-df-weyl-sum"],"display":"df-weyl-sum — Weyl Sum","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-weyl-sum"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-weyl-sum</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-weyl-sum — Weyl Sum"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\\in\\omega\\land f:\\{1,\\ldots,N\\}\\to\\mathbb R\">\\(N\\in\\omega\\land f:\\{1,\\ldots,N\\}\\to\\mathbb R\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb C\">\\(e:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb C\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e(x)\\coloneqq\\exp(2\\pi ix)\">\\(e(x)\\coloneqq\\exp(2\\pi ix)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_N(f)\\in\\mathbb C\">\\(S_N(f)\\in\\mathbb C\\)</span> (Weyl sum defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{WeylSum}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{WeylSum}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (graph predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}weyl\\text{-}sum\\text{-}phase} \\vdash e(x)\\coloneqq\\exp(2\\pi ix)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}weyl\\text{-}sum\\text{-}phase} \\vdash e(x)\\coloneqq\\exp(2\\pi ix)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}weyl\\text{-}sum\\text{-}value} \\vdash S_N(f)\\coloneqq\\sum_{n=1}^{N}e(f(n))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}weyl\\text{-}sum\\text{-}value} \\vdash S_N(f)\\coloneqq\\sum_{n=1}^{N}e(f(n))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}weyl\\text{-}sum\\text{-}graph} \\vdash \\operatorname{WeylSum}_S(z,N,f)\\leftrightarrow N\\in\\omega\\land f:\\{1,\\ldots,N\\}\\to\\mathbb R\\land z=\\sum_{n=1}^{N}\\exp(2\\pi if(n))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}weyl\\text{-}sum\\text{-}graph} \\vdash \\operatorname{WeylSum}_S(z,N,f)\\leftrightarrow N\\in\\omega\\land f:\\{1,\\ldots,N\\}\\to\\mathbb R\\land z=\\sum_{n=1}^{N}\\exp(2\\pi if(n))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Weyl sums are exponential sums used in equidistribution and analytic number theory.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-sum</code> defines a sum of submodules, not finite numerical summation; <code>58-df-trigonometric-sum</code> already depends on this atom, so neither is an upstream dependency here.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"N\\in\\omega\\land f:\\{1,\\ldots,N\\}\\to\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"e:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb C","display":false},{"tex":"e(x)\\coloneqq\\exp(2\\pi ix)","display":false},{"tex":"S_N(f)\\in\\mathbb C","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{WeylSum}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}weyl\\text{-}sum\\text{-}phase} \\vdash e(x)\\coloneqq\\exp(2\\pi ix)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}weyl\\text{-}sum\\text{-}value} \\vdash S_N(f)\\coloneqq\\sum_{n=1}^{N}e(f(n))","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}weyl\\text{-}sum\\text{-}graph} \\vdash \\operatorname{WeylSum}_S(z,N,f)\\leftrightarrow N\\in\\omega\\land f:\\{1,\\ldots,N\\}\\to\\mathbb R\\land z=\\sum_{n=1}^{N}\\exp(2\\pi if(n))","display":true}],"bytes":1115,"backlinks":[{"id":"5056e5ab9eec996f","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1391","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-weyl-sum.md|58-df-weyl-sum]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":[]}